[statement]
A `!` entry in the world forbids what a requested package depends on, as
one in the request does: the world states `!lib`, `app` needs `lib`, and
apk refuses.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:lib

P:lib
V:1

P:base
V:1

[installed]
P:base
V:1

[world]
base
!lib

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
| ERROR: unable to select packages:
|   lib-1:
|     breaks: world[!lib]
|     satisfies: app-1[lib]
refused
